                <div style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif; font-weight: bold;"><u>Method of Payments</u></font>.</div>
